/**
 * @mainpage LINE Solver
 *
 * Welcome to the LINE Solver MATLAB API documentation.
 *
 * @section documentation_sec API Documentation
 *
 * - @ref api_core "Core Modules" - Networks, nodes, classes, distributions, solvers
 * - @ref api_cache "Cache Algorithms" - Cache performance analysis
 * - @ref api_lossn "Loss Networks" - Analysis of networks with blocking
 * - @ref api_lsn "Layered Stochastic Networks" - Layered queueing network analysis
 * - @ref api_mc "Markov Chain Utilities" - CTMC and DTMC analysis tools
 * - @ref api_mam "Matrix-Analytic Methods" - QBD processes and matrix-analytic solutions
 * - @ref api_npfqn "Non-Product-Form Networks" - Approximations for intractable queueing networks
 * - @ref api_polling "Polling Systems" - Analysis of gated, exhaustive, and k-limited polling
 * - @ref api_pfqn "Product-Form Queueing Networks" - MVA, convolution, and normalizing constant methods
 * - @ref api_qsys "Queueing Systems" - Single-station queueing system analysis
 * - @ref api_rl "Reinforcement Learning" - RL utilities for queueing control
 * - @ref api_sn "Stochastic Network Utilities" - Network analysis and transformation utilities
 * - @ref api_utilities "Utilities and Constants" - Helper functions, constants, and enumerations
 *
 * @section module_locations_sec Module Locations
 *
 * | Category | MATLAB Path | Description |
 * |----------|-------------|-------------|
 * | Cache API | matlab/src/api/cache/ | Cache analysis algorithms |
 * | Constants | matlab/src/lang/constant/ | Enumerations and global constants |
 * | Core | matlab/src/lang/ | Network, Node, and JobClass definitions |
 * | Distributions | matlab/src/lang/processes/ | Exp, Erlang, PH, MAP, etc. |
 * | Layered Networks | matlab/src/lang/layered/ | LayeredNetwork, Task, Activity |
 * | LossN API | matlab/src/api/lossn/ | Loss network algorithms |
 * | LSN API | matlab/src/api/lsn/ | Layered stochastic network utilities |
 * | MAM API | matlab/src/api/mam/ | Matrix-analytic methods |
 * | MC API | matlab/src/api/mc/ | Markov chain analysis |
 * | Nodes | matlab/src/lang/nodes/ | Queue, Source, Sink, etc. |
 * | NPFQN API | matlab/src/api/npfqn/ | Non-product-form network approximations |
 * | PFQN API | matlab/src/api/pfqn/ | Product-form queueing network algorithms |
 * | Polling API | matlab/src/api/polling/ | Polling system algorithms |
 * | Qsys API | matlab/src/api/qsys/ | Single queueing system formulas |
 * | RL API | matlab/src/api/rl/ | Reinforcement learning utilities |
 * | SN API | matlab/src/api/sn/ | Stochastic network utilities |
 * | Solvers | matlab/src/solvers/ | MVA, CTMC, Fluid, MAM, etc. |
 *
 * @section license_sec License
 *
 * <a href="../license.html">BSD-3 License</a>
